==English==

===Verb===
'''to [[usher]] [[in]]'''

# To [[announce]] the [[arrival]] of something; to [[herald]].
# To [[begin]] something with [[preparatory]] material; to [[introduce]].
#:''It '''ushered in''' a whole new era.''

